	))(text "POWER. 24 V from the cabinet; the 5 V rail is made on the board." (at 12.7 16.51 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "ab1e0ea5-2f2a-4a08-99e5-665437d1e7ff"))(text "One common ground: the outputs are not isolated, so there is nothing to" (at 12.7 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "4fe76643-eb7d-47e6-936b-a02d92be4e0d"))(text "keep apart. See the header of build_project.py for what that costs." (at 12.7 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "26a97176-5e0b-4857-94eb-30aca2b3c87d"))(rectangle (start 12.7 40.64) (end 190.5 111.76) (stroke (width 0.2) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "5f8167a5-b8c0-421d-aa62-fbc0d5c0a8cb"))(text "5 V LOGIC SUPPLY - MADE ON BOARD FROM 24 V" (at 15.24 38.1 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "edf40217-b38b-43c4-be29-c72cd3ee3269"))(text "Feeds the buffers, the optocoupler LEDs on the PC side, the MCU, the" (at 15.24 48.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "97e2e74d-4426-4ea3-831e-3ce34b25ec5e"))(text "RS232 transceiver and the handwheel. An LM2596S-5.0 buck off V24, so the" (at 15.24 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "5d942f39-6559-41e6-b251-fcb365b0db44"))(text "board takes one supply. About 0.4 W lost at 0.4 A, where a 7805 would burn 7.6 W." (at 15.24 58.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "02aecb36-7198-41ff-b57b-6cd27d29451f"))(wire (pts (xy 76.2 78.74)(xy 68.58 78.74)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "93001d73-798a-4d77-8a5d-328142fc449f"))(global_label "V24" (shape passive) (at 68.58 78.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "b0d41f89-998d-467d-b96c-679f6cef2d4e"))(wire (pts (xy 76.2 83.82)(xy 68.58 83.82)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "33ff9c2f-52b4-46f5-9dfb-5953c06652eb"))(global_label "GND" (shape passive) (at 68.58 83.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "09caa0e6-837f-4be7-b547